+        // Link the new group into the project's main group, otherwise it (and the
+        // file references it holds, e.g. PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy) stays unreachable
+        // from the project root. CocoaPods' privacy manifest aggregation then
+        // crashes with "Consistency issue: no parent for object" when it tries to
